          ],
          "content": "Chapter 10 — Light: Mirrors and Lenses"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.082,
            0.744,
            0.16
          ],
          "content": "12. Place a pencil behind a transparent glass tumbler (Fig. 10.28a). Now fill the tumbler halfway with water (Fig. 10.28b). How does the pencil appear when viewed through the water? **Explain** why its shape appears changed."
        },
        {
